                            p.lead Ciphergram is a backend systems consultancy founded by engineers who specialize in Go, AWS, and distributed systems design. We focus on infrastructure-level problems that directly affect cost, performance, and scalability—not front-end experiments or generic product builds.
                            p We work the way your CTO or platform lead would want: narrow scope, explicit tradeoffs, and recommendations you can implement or hand to your team with confidence.
                            h4 Why technical leaders bring us in
                            ul
                                li Deep Go backend engineering for services, workers, and high-throughput paths
                                li Hands-on AWS and Lambda experience—not slideware architecture
                                li Systems architecture background spanning event-driven design, reliability, and cost-aware scaling
                            p Since 2014 we have shipped and advised on production systems. Today the practice is deliberately focused: AWS cost optimization, backend performance engineering, and serverless migration for SaaS and scaling startups.
